Create a Custom IAM Policy:-

- The customer-managed IAM policy CustomS3ReadPolicy was created to provide read-only access to the specified S3 bucket 
- It allows the authorized user to list bucket contents and read or download objects, without granting upload, overwrite, or delete permissions. 
-This practical demonstrates the principle of least privilege in AWS IAM.This policy itself does not grant upload or delete permissions but other policies attached to
 the same user or group may grant them.
